        "description": "Self or live orbat:edit hierarchy. GET returns null when absent and audits other-user reads. PATCH upserts the full note with status required; omitted reason/minute values reset to null. late_unsure requires at least one nonnegative minute estimate. Other statuses clear minute values. Reason trims and is limited to 500 characters. DELETE missing note returns404. Staff may modify past operations; other callers respect cutoff. Mutation audit redacts reasons and commits with outbox. Unknown/repeated query parameters are rejected. All timestamps are UTC ISO strings. Active database bots use superadmin permissions; invalid explicit authorization never falls back to a session.",
